/* =========================================================================
   Playback Flow：涵蓋所有 S-Expression 組合子、深層遞迴巨集樹、原型串接、軸心倒影與全局移調指令
   - (layer ...) 平行疊加
   - (canon ...) 卡農自動錯位追逐（含單樂器卡農、0 偏移卡農、串接原型卡農、巢狀子表達式卡農）
   - (loop ...) 循環重複（含串接原型循環）
   - (seq ...) 序列串接
   - (play ...) 綁定抽象動機與樂器（含負/零/正偏移）
   - (reverse ...) 逆行、(flip ... [axis]) 軸心倒影、(transpose ...) 移調、(minor ...)/(major ...) 調式轉換、(vary ...) 多重變奏
   - {?+2} / {?-2} / {?=F#} / {?=Bb} / {?=C} 播放期全局轉調
   ========================================================================= */

-> A
-> B
-> Rest
-> Waltz
-> (layer
(canon WeirdMotif (Violin Viola Cello) 1)
(loop WeirdPulse Marimba 2))
-> (canon WeirdStuff (Violin Viola Cello) 1)
-> (layer
(seq
(play (reverse WeirdMotif) Harpsichord)
(play (flip WeirdMotif) Flute)
(play (flip WeirdMotif 60) Piccolo)
(play (transpose WeirdMotif 5) Clarinet)
(play (transpose +7 WeirdMotif) TenorSax)
(play (minor (major WeirdMotif)) Oboe)
(play (vary WeirdMotif +7 reverse flip) Xylophone))
(loop WeirdPulse PizzicatoStrings 7)
(loop (transpose WeirdPulse -12) Bassoon 7))
-> (layer
(play (WeirdMotif WeirdPulse) Violin 0)
(play WeirdMotif Flute -1)
(play WeirdMotif Oboe 2)
(play WeirdPulse Clarinet 1)
(loop (WeirdMotif WeirdPulse) Cello 1)
(canon WeirdMotif (Viola) 0)
(canon WeirdPulse (Trumpet FrenchHorn) 0)
(canon (WeirdMotif WeirdPulse) (SopranoSax AltoSax) 1)
(play (vary (reverse (flip (transpose (minor (major (WeirdMotif WeirdPulse))) +5))) -3 reverse flip) Harpsichord 0))
-> (canon (layer (play WeirdMotif Violin) (play WeirdPulse Cello)) (Flute Oboe) 1)
-> {?+2}
-> A
-> {?-2}
-> B
-> {?=F#}
-> C
-> {?=Bb}
-> C
-> {?=C}
-> D
-> M5
-> M7
-> M11
-> M13
-> Poly
-> Babel
-> TempoAbyss
-> TempoHyper
-> TempoWhiplash
-> LexerCrunch
-> TupletLab
-> RangeAndDynamics
-> ChordAndKeyOdyssey
-> StaggeredAnacrusis
-> BlackMIDI88
-> MicroMacroMeter
-> StereoWorldFX
->#

